      "text": "LOCKED: one-shot .smt2\n(process_run exists,\nlib.rs:3775); callees inlined;\nincremental BMC only\n(contracts.md:36); Vec/String =\narray+len with no caps;\nstring_eq stays an uninterpreted\nfn; Skipped gate stays\nfail-closed. D1 assumed (b):\nchecker lives in compiler/ only,\nRust vow keeps ESBMC.",
      "originalText": "LOCKED: one-shot .smt2 (process_run exists, lib.rs:3775); callees inlined; incremental BMC only (contracts.md:36); Vec/String = array+len with no caps; string_eq stays an uninterpreted fn; Skipped gate stays fail-closed. D1 assumed (b): checker lives in compiler/ only, Rust vow keeps ESBMC.",
